"creation": "2026-05-10 14:44:05.126804", "modified": "2026-05-10 14:44:05.126804", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Comment", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": "Sarah Connor", "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Lead", "reference_name": "CRM-LEAD-2026-00002", "reference_owner": null, "content": "<p>Bob mentioned they had a poor experience with their last CRM. He emphasized that onboarding support and data migration are top priorities. Need to loop in the customer success team before the next call.</p>", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0je5vjsr2", "creation": "2026-05-08 14:44:05.126804", "modified": "2026-05-08 14:44:05.126804", "modified_by": "john.demo@example.com", "owner": "john.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Comment", "comment_email": "john.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": "John Parker", "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Lead", "reference_name": "CRM-LEAD-2026-00003", "reference_owner": null, "content": "<p>Carol is temporarily unavailable — on leave until end of month. Her colleague Mark is the interim contact. Revisit in 3 weeks with updated pricing deck.</p>", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0jebobtih", "creation": "2026-05-19 20:14:05.100753", "modified": "2026-05-19 20:14:05.100753", "modified_by": "Administrator", "owner": "Administrator", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Assigned", "comment_email": "Administrator", "subject": null, "comment_by": null, "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Task", "reference_name": "6", "reference_owner": null, "content": "Administrator assigned Sarah Connor: Confirm annual plan details", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0jmltugbb", "creation": "2026-03-24 14:44:05.126804", "modified": "2026-03-24 14:44:05.126804", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Comment", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": "Sarah Connor", "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Lead", "reference_name": "CRM-LEAD-2026-00001", "reference_owner": null, "content": "<p>Initial discovery call was very productive. Alice's team of ~300 engineers is actively evaluating CRM solutions. She mentioned budget has already been approved — just need to get sign-off from the VP of Sales.</p>", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0jrq6h051", "creation": "2026-04-08 14:44:05.126804", "modified": "2026-04-08 14:44:05.126804", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Comment", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": "Sarah Connor", "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Lead", "reference_name": "CRM-LEAD-2026-00004", "reference_owner": null, "content": "<p>Technical demo completed successfully. David's engineering team was impressed with the API and custom field options. He's requesting pricing for 15 seats — send the proposal by Friday.</p>", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0sjvp6ikj", "creation": "2026-03-30 14:44:06.424758", "modified": "2026-03-30 14:44:06.424758", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Assigned", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": null, "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Deal", "reference_name": "CRM-DEAL-2026-00001", "reference_owner": null, "content": "Administrator assigned Sarah Connor: Assignment for CRM Deal CRM-DEAL-2026-00001", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0srdo1jjp", "creation": "2026-03-30 14:44:06.424758", "modified": "2026-03-30 14:44:06.424758", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Shared", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": null, "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Deal", "reference_name": "CRM-DEAL-2026-00001", "reference_owner": null, "content": "Administrator shared this document with Sarah Connor", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0t4a1meak", "creation": "2026-04-12 14:44:06.424758", "modified": "2026-04-12 14:44:06.424758", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Assigned", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": null, "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Deal", "reference_name": "CRM-DEAL-2026-00002", "reference_owner": null, "content": "Administrator assigned Sarah Connor: Assignment for CRM Deal CRM-DEAL-2026-00002", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comments": null, "_assign": null, "_liked_by": null}, {"name": "a0teeoth6s", "creation": "2026-04-12 14:44:06.424758", "modified": "2026-04-12 14:44:06.424758", "modified_by": "sarah.demo@example.com", "owner": "sarah.demo@example.com", "docstatus": 0, "idx": 0, "comment_type": "Shared", "comment_email": "sarah.demo@example.com", "subject": null, "comment_by": null, "published": 0, "seen": 0, "reference_doctype": "CRM Deal", "reference_name": "CRM-DEAL-2026-00002", "reference_owner": null, "content": "Administrator shared this document with Sarah Connor", "ip_address": null, "_user_tags": null, "_comme